Scope / 适用范围

This license covers the tool source code and the analysis data under shared/
(names, signatures, field layouts, comments and notes written by the
contributors). The shared/ data was chosen to use the same MIT license so that
one license governs the whole repository and attribution is preserved when the
tables are reused in other projects.

本许可覆盖工具代码和 shared/ 下的分析数据（贡献者自己写的名字、签名、字段布局、
注释与笔记）。shared/ 数据与工具使用同一 MIT 许可，整库一种许可，且复用时保留署名。

Third-party code bundled under edf6re_lib/ keeps its original license; see the
LICENSE.* files in that directory (for example edf6re_lib/LICENSE.edf6-cpk).

This repository contains no game code or game data. EARTH DEFENSE FORCE 6 and
its files are the property of their respective owners; every user generates
disassembly, pseudocode and indexes locally from their own legally obtained copy.
